{"text":"kuruntokai","n":136,"lines":["காமங் காமம் என்ப காமம்","அணங்கும் பிணியும் அன்றே நுணங்கிக்","கடுத்தலுந் தணிதலும் இன்றே யானை","குளகுமென் றாள்மதம் போலப்","பாணியும் உடைத்தது காணுநர்ப் பெறினே"],"tr":["kāmaṅ kāmam eṉpa kāmam","aṇaṅkum piṇiyum aṉṟē nuṇaṅkik","kaṭuttalun taṇitalum iṉṟē yāṉai","kuḷakumeṉ ṟāḷmatam pōlap","pāṇiyum uṭaittatu kāṇunarp peṟiṉē"],"colophon":{"tinai":"kuṟiñci","tinai_ta":"குறிஞ்சி","speaker_ta":"தலைவன் கூற்று","poet_ta":"மிளைப்பெருங் கந்தனார்","speaker_en":"the hero (talaivaṉ)","poet_tr":"Miḷaipperuṅ Kantaṉār"},"scan":{"meter":"nēricai āciriyappā","ok":true,"checks":[{"name":"lines","ok":true,"detail":"5 lines"},{"name":"feet per line","ok":true,"detail":"4×4, 1×3 feet"},{"name":"foot types","ok":true,"detail":"iyaṟcīr 19"},{"name":"linkage","ok":true,"detail":"āciriyattaḷai 9, veṇṭaḷai 9"},{"name":"ending","ok":true,"detail":"ends on ஏ"}],"ending":"ஏ","lines":[[{"text":"காமங்","tr":"kāmaṅ","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கா","tr":"kā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"மங்","tr":"maṅ"}]},{"text":"காமம்","tr":"kāmam","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கா","tr":"kā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"மம்","tr":"mam"}]},{"text":"என்ப","tr":"eṉpa","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"என்","tr":"eṉ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ப","tr":"pa"}]},{"text":"காமம்","tr":"kāmam","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கா","tr":"kā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"மம்","tr":"mam"}]}],[{"text":"அணங்கும்","tr":"aṇaṅkum","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"அணங்","tr":"aṇaṅ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"கும்","tr":"kum"}]},{"text":"பிணியும்","tr":"piṇiyum","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"பிணி","tr":"piṇi"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"யும்","tr":"yum"}]},{"text":"அன்றே","tr":"aṉṟē","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"அன்","tr":"aṉ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"றே","tr":"ṟē"}]},{"text":"நுணங்கிக்","tr":"nuṇaṅkik","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"நுணங்","tr":"nuṇaṅ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"கிக்","tr":"kik"}]}],[{"text":"கடுத்தலுந்","tr":"kaṭuttalun","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"கடுத்","tr":"kaṭut"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"தலுந்","tr":"talun"}]},{"text":"தணிதலும்","tr":"taṇitalum","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"தணி","tr":"taṇi"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"தலும்","tr":"talum"}]},{"text":"இன்றே","tr":"iṉṟē","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"இன்","tr":"iṉ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"றே","tr":"ṟē"}]},{"text":"யானை","tr":"yāṉai","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"யா","tr":"yā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"னை","tr":"ṉai"}]}],[{"text":"குளகுமென்","tr":"kuḷakumeṉ","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"குள","tr":"kuḷa"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"குமென்","tr":"kumeṉ"}]},{"text":"றாள்மதம்","tr":"ṟāḷmatam","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"றாள்","tr":"ṟāḷ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"மதம்","tr":"matam"}]},{"text":"போலப்","tr":"pōlap","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"போ","tr":"pō"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"லப்","tr":"lap"}]}],[{"text":"பாணியும்","tr":"pāṇiyum","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"பா","tr":"pā"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"ணியும்","tr":"ṇiyum"}]},{"text":"உடைத்தது","tr":"uṭaittatu","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"உடைத்","tr":"uṭait"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"தது","tr":"tatu"}]},{"text":"காணுநர்ப்","tr":"kāṇunarp","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கா","tr":"kā"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"ணுநர்ப்","tr":"ṇunarp"}]},{"text":"பெறினே","tr":"peṟiṉē","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"பெறி","tr":"peṟi"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"னே","tr":"ṉē"}]}]]},"ai":{"lines":[{"words":[{"surface":"காமம்","parts":[{"text":"காமம்","lemma":"காமம்","gloss":"desire"}],"gloss":"desire"},{"surface":"காமம்","parts":[{"text":"காமம்","lemma":"காமம்","gloss":"desire"}],"gloss":"desire"},{"surface":"என்ப","parts":[{"text":"என்","lemma":"என்","gloss":"say"},{"text":"ப","lemma":"ப","gloss":"they"}],"gloss":"they say"},{"surface":"காமம்","parts":[{"text":"காமம்","lemma":"காமம்","gloss":"desire"}],"gloss":"desire"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"அணங்கும்","parts":[{"text":"அணங்கு","lemma":"அணங்கு","gloss":"torment"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"and"}],"gloss":"torment and"},{"surface":"பிணியும்","parts":[{"text":"பிணி","lemma":"பிணி","gloss":"sickness"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"and"}],"gloss":"sickness and"},{"surface":"அன்றே","parts":[{"text":"அன்று","lemma":"அன்று","gloss":"it is not"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"it is not indeed"},{"surface":"நுணங்கி","parts":[{"text":"நுணங்கு","lemma":"நுணங்கு","gloss":"shrink"},{"text":"இ","lemma":"இ","gloss":"having"}],"gloss":"having shrunk"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"கடுத்தலும்","parts":[{"text":"கடு","lemma":"கடு","gloss":"throb"},{"text":"த்தல்","lemma":"த்தல்","gloss":"verbal noun suffix"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"and"}],"gloss":"throbbing and"},{"surface":"தணிதலும்","parts":[{"text":"தணி","lemma":"தணி","gloss":"subside"},{"text":"தல்","lemma":"தல்","gloss":"verbal noun suffix"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"and"}],"gloss":"subsiding and"},{"surface":"இன்றே","parts":[{"text":"இன்று","lemma":"இன்று","gloss":"is not"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"is not indeed"},{"surface":"யானை","parts":[{"text":"யானை","lemma":"யானை","gloss":"elephant"}],"gloss":"elephant"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"குளகுமென்","parts":[{"text":"குளகுமென்","lemma":"குளகுமென்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"றாள்மதம்","parts":[{"text":"றாள்மதம்","lemma":"றாள்மதம்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"போலப்","parts":[{"text":"போலப்","lemma":"போலப்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true}],"as_printed":true},{"words":[{"surface":"பாணியும்","parts":[{"text":"பாணி","lemma":"பாணி","gloss":"restraint"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"also"}],"gloss":"restraint also"},{"surface":"உடைத்தது","parts":[{"text":"உடைத்து","lemma":"உடைத்து","gloss":"it possesses"},{"text":"அது","lemma":"அது","gloss":"it"}],"gloss":"it possesses"},{"surface":"காணுநர்","parts":[{"text":"காண்","lemma":"காண்","gloss":"see"},{"text":"உநர்","lemma":"உநர்","gloss":"they who"}],"gloss":"beholders"},{"surface":"பெறினே","parts":[{"text":"பெறின்","lemma":"பெறின்","gloss":"if obtains"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"if indeed it obtains"}]}],"literal":"Desire, desire, they say, desire / is not torment and sickness indeed; having shrunk, / throbbing and subsiding are not indeed; like the deep musth / of an elephant having chewed green leaves, / it also possesses restraint, if indeed it obtains beholders.","translation":"People speak of desire, desire, and desire. But desire is neither a tormenting spirit nor a disease. It does not shrink, nor does it have a throbbing rise and a subsiding fall. Like the deep musth of an elephant that has chewed green leaves, it also has a sense of restraint, if only it meets those who can perceive it.","modern":"மக்கள் காமம் காமம் என்று சொல்கிறார்கள். காமம் என்பது வருத்தும் தெய்வமோ அல்லது நோயோ அல்ல. அது சுருங்கி, மிகுந்து தோன்றுவதும் பின்பு தணிந்து போவதும் இல்லை. தழைகளைத் தின்ற யானையின் மிகுந்த மதநீர் போல, அதனைக் காண்பவரைக் கண்டால் அது அடங்கித் தோன்றும் தன்மையையும் உடையது.","explanation":"The hero speaks about the nature of his love for the heroine. People often speak of desire as if it were a disease or a tormenting spirit, but the hero explains that it is far more constant and deep. It does not fluctuate wildly, throbbing and subsiding, nor does it shrink away. He compares his love to the deep musth of an elephant that has fed on green leaves. Just as the elephant's musth can be restrained or delayed when it encounters a skilled handler or onlooker, his intense passion is kept under control and hidden out of restraint when he is in the presence of others who might observe him.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"}}